{"id":"word:hebrew:H2236","type":"word","title":"זָרַק","subtitle":"H2236 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"to sprinkle (fluid or solid particles)","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to זָרַק (H2236) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: v.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 35 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"זָרַק (zâraq) means to sprinkle (fluid or solid particles) First listed occurrence: 2Chr 29 22."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"זָרַק","transliteration":"zâraq","pronunciation":"zaw-rak'","strong":"H2236","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2236","partOfSpeech":"v","forms":["וַ/יִּזְרְק֤וּ","וַ/יִּזְרְק֥וּ","וְ/זָרְק֡וּ","וְ֠/זָרְקוּ","וַ/יִּזְרֹ֨ק"],"morphs":[["HC/Vqw3ms",6],["HC/Vqw3mp",5],["HC/Vqq3cp",5],["HVqi2ms",2],["HC/Vqq2ms",2],["HVqi3ms",2],["HC/Vqw3ms/Sp3ms",2],["HVQp3ms",2],["HVqrmpa",1],["HC/Vqp3ms/Sp3ms",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"to sprinkle (fluid or solid particles)","usage":"be here and there, scatter, sprinkle, strew.","full":"H2236. zaraq זָרַק verb to toss or throw (in a volume), scatter abundantly (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic זְרַק id. , disperse ; Assyrian zarâ‡u Lotz TP138 Jäger BAS ii. 292 Anm. **; compare also Arabic cast at, pierce , and javelin = Ethiopic ) — Qal Perfect ׳ז Exod 24:6 ; Lev 17:6 , suffix זְרָקוֺ Exod 9:8 , זָָֽרְקָה Hosea 7:9 (12 t. Perfect); Imperfect יִזְרֹק Lev 7:2 16 t.; Infinitive לִזְרֹק Ezek 43:18 ; Imperative זְרֹק 10:2 ; Participle זֹרֵק Lev 7:14 , plural זֹרְקִים 2Chr 30:16 ; 1 toss (in handfuls, see Exod 9:8 ; or from a bowl , מִזְרָק ; opposed to הִזָּה to sprinkle with the finger): a. cummin Isa 28:25 , dust, followed by עַל 2Chr 34:4 ; Job 2:12 , ashes השׁמימה , heavenward, Exod 9:8 , 10 (P), coals of fire העיר על Ezek 10:2 . b. blood , (ה)מזבה על throw (from a bowl) against the altar Exod 24:6 (JE), Lev 17:6 (H), Num 18:17 (P), 2Kin 16:13 , 15 ; Ezek 43:18 , especially in the ritual, סביב חמזבח על against the altar round about Exod 29:16 , 20 ; Lev 1:5 , 11 ; 3:2 , 8 , 13 ; 7:2 ; 8:19 , 24 ; 9:12 , 18 (all P); followed by העם על Exod 24:8 (JE), followed by המזבחה 2Chr 29:22 (3 t. in verse); without designation of place Lev 7:14 (P), 2Chr 30:16 ; 35:11 . c. water for purification, followed by על , Ezek 36:25 . 2 intransitive (si vera lectio) Hosea 7:9 בּוֺ זָָֽרְקָה שֵׂיבָה גַּם grey hairs are profuse upon him (? read זָָֽרְחָה , as in 2Chr 26:19 ). Pu`al Perfect זֹרַק , of water of purification poured over ( עַל ) one defiled by a corpse Num 19:18 , 20 (P).","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 29 22","keyReferences":["2Chr 29 22","2Chr 29 22","2Chr 29 22","2Chr 30 16","2Chr 34 4","2Chr 35 11","2Kgs 16 13","2Kgs 16 15"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":35,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 29 22","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַֽ/יִּזְרְק֖וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 22","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּזְרְק֤וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 22","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּזְרְק֥וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"2Chr 30 16","book":"2Chr","chapter":30,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"זֹרְקִ֣ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVqrmpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 34 4","book":"2Chr","chapter":34,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּזְרֹק֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"2Chr 35 11","book":"2Chr","chapter":35,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּזְרְק֤וּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3mp"},{"reference":"2Kgs 16 13","book":"2Kgs","chapter":16,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּזְרֹ֛ק","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqw3ms"},{"reference":"2Kgs 16 15","book":"2